# Flutter app (`mac_dev_cleaner`)

macOS desktop UI; calls `MacDevCleaner` from core — **no duplicate scan rules** in widgets.

## Structure

- `lib/controller/cleaner_controller.dart` — `ChangeNotifier`: scan phase, items, selection, filters, treemap drill, doctor/history logs.
- `lib/screens/` — Home (Results/Details tabs), Doctor, History.
- `lib/widgets/` — tiles, treemap, activity log, FDA onboarding, plan dialog.
- `lib/treemap/` — layout math (squarify), not platform code.

## UI patterns

- Scan progress: `ScanActivityLog` + `ScanLogEntry` from core; Doctor tab reuses log widget with custom title.
- List checkboxes: only pass non-null `Checkbox.value` (disabled rows use `false` + `onChanged: null`).
- Destructive clean: confirm via plan summary; respect Trash vs permanent delete flags from controller.

## Run & test

```bash
make run-app
make test   # includes flutter test for this app
```

Use **FVM** (`make` scripts already do). macOS entitlements: non-sandboxed for full disk scan; do not re-enable App Sandbox without product discussion.

## Tests

- Inject `CleanerController` with fake `ScanItem` lists; avoid hitting real filesystem in widget tests.
